# Supabase CLI local state — added 2026-07-30 (Opus audit finding L10).
# `supabase/.temp/` holds files the CLI writes and rewrites as a side effect of commands
# like `supabase link` and `supabase db query` (e.g. `linked-project.json`). It is local
# machine state, not project source, it is untracked, and Prettier has no business
# reformatting it. This was the one *genuine* format:check failure among the 23 reported —
# every other one was a CRLF-versus-LF false failure, now fixed by `.gitattributes`.
supabase/.temp/
